.TH QUIPU-PROPOSE-LIST 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-propose\-list \- List schema change proposals, optionally by status
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu propose list\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-status\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List schema change proposals, optionally by status
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Status to record or filter
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
